================================================================================
3. AUDIO FILES IN Songs/  —  demonstration material
================================================================================

The MP3 files in Songs/ are not original recordings. They were generated with
the Suno API and are included solely so that the "Make your own Hit!" page of
the published Power BI report has audio to play, since a live generation API
cannot be called from a public report.

They are provided for demonstration and educational use in the context of this
project. Reuse of AI-generated audio is governed by the terms of the service
that produced it; anyone wishing to use these files outside this project should
consult Suno's terms rather than relying on the licences above. No claim of
ownership over the underlying model outputs is made or implied.


